PRESERVATION AND LIMITS
Only traditional compositing/resampling was used. All supplied source PNGs remain unchanged; their hashes were checked before/after. No image generation, AI edit, new character drawing, relighting, alpha cleanup, per-frame fitting, or source overwrite occurred. The shared flat floor provides equal background conditions but does not alter baked sprite lighting. Low-alpha artifacts, pose placement and baked effects are not hidden or corrected.

This is NOT engine validation, performance validation, a production import recipe, metric calibration, a complete animation review, a test of collision/root motion, or approval of these experimental enemy cameras. No repository, user computer or engine was accessed. The archive contains only the two review PNGs, this README, and the selection/scale manifest; original asset packs are separate.

